Third-party / vendored components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Opquast test engine vendored under `packages/opquast-test-runner/` is a
separate project by Temesis SAS, distributed under the Mozilla Public License,
version 2.0 (MPL-2.0, see LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt). Its own license and copyright
notices are kept intact within that directory
(packages/opquast-test-runner/LICENSE) and are unaffected by the tri-license
above.

The V5 engine overlay under `data/engine-overlay/` (rules, rulesets and
`oqs-tests-overlay.js`), Copyright (c) 2026 Opquast, extends that engine and is
distributed under the same Mozilla Public License, version 2.0 (MPL-2.0, see
LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt), not under the tri-license above. Its notice is in
`oqs-tests-overlay.js`.

Bundled engine libraries copied into `public/engine/` at build time retain their
respective upstream licenses: jQuery 3.7.1 + jQuery Migrate 3.5.2 (MIT, OpenJS
Foundation) and JSCSSP `cssParser.js` (MPL-1.1 / GPL-2.0 / LGPL-2.1). See
THIRD-PARTY.md for the full attribution.

